---
// Photographic concrete texture over the page gradient (replaces the
// earlier feTurbulence-based synthetic grain attempts entirely — both
// the sharp-grain and low-frequency-mottle versions are gone, nothing
// from either remains). Static (no animation), so it needs no
// prefers-reduced-motion handling. Sits at z-0, above body's gradient
// (which isn't part of the stacking order at all — it's the root canvas
// paint) and below real content, which is z-10 throughout this layout.
//
// grayscale(1) strips the texture's own color entirely, so overlay blend
// tints it purely from whatever gradient color sits beneath it — stays
// locked to the --color-green-dark/--color-charcoal gradient, no new
// color introduced.
---

<div
  class="fixed inset-0 z-0"
  style="
    background-image: url('/textures/concrete-046.jpg');
    background-repeat: repeat;
    background-size: 640px;
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.05);
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    opacity: 0.35;
    pointer-events: none;
  "
  aria-hidden="true"
>
</div>
